:name: SWP master-slave link
:description: A bare ETSI TS 102 613 SWP link — one controller (CLF) with a raw
:description: TCP socket, one slave (UICC) — with no CPU and no firmware.

$repl ?= @platforms/swp_link.repl

using sysbus
mach create "board"

# The peripherals are plain C# and are compiled by the Monitor at load time, so
# this works against a stock Renode with nothing built into the tree.
include @peripherals/SWP.cs
include @peripherals/SWPController.cs
include @peripherals/SWPSlave.cs

machine LoadPlatformDescription $repl

echo ""
echo "SWP link ready."
echo "  raw link data:  tcp://127.0.0.1:3460   (bytes in -> slave, slave bytes -> out)"
echo ""
echo "  swp Activate / swp Suspend / swp Resume / swp Deactivate"
echo "  swp Status ; uicc Status ; uicc LastReceived"
echo ""
